# For Vercel + Render, set these public build-time variables in Vercel.
# Replace YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE with the actual Render hostname; do not use this placeholder literally.
# VITE_API_URL=https://YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE.onrender.com/api
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE.onrender.com
# Locally, leave unset to use Vite's proxy. Existing production builds retain the legacy Railway fallback until overridden.
